{"title":"Career roadmap · Policy Researcher","role":"Policy Researcher","summary":"A Policy Researcher conducts structured research to understand public problems, evaluate policies, analyse evidence, and develop recommendations for governments, think tanks, research institutions, defence organisations, NGOs, international organisations, and consulting firms.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career alignment"},{"type":"p","text":"A Policy Researcher conducts structured research to understand public problems, evaluate policies, analyse evidence, and develop recommendations for governments, think tanks, research institutions, defence organisations, NGOs, international organisations, and consulting firms."},{"type":"p","text":"With Defence & Strategic Studies, the strongest career direction is defence policy, national security, geopolitics, strategic affairs, military studies, foreign policy, conflict studies, and emerging security technologies."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Roles","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Research Intern, Research Assistant"},{"text":"Literature review, data collection, policy research"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"Policy Research Associate, Junior Policy Analyst"},{"text":"Policy analysis and research"}],[{"text":"Core Career"},{"text":"Policy Researcher, Strategic Affairs Analyst"},{"text":"Defence, security and geopolitical analysis"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"Senior Policy Analyst, Research Fellow"},{"text":"Independent research and policy recommendations"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Senior Research Fellow, Strategic Affairs Specialist"},{"text":"Leading research programmes"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Programme Director, Research Director"},{"text":"Research strategy and institutional leadership"}],[{"text":"Specialist"},{"text":"Defe