nce Economics Analyst"},{"text":"Geopolitical Risk Specialist"},{"text":"Security Policy Specialist"},{"text":"Technology Policy Researcher"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What Employers May Test"},{"type":"h","text":"Policy analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Identify a public-policy problem and propose three policy alternatives."},{"type":"h","text":"Strategic analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"What factors should be considered when assessing a country's security environment?"},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"p","text":"How would you determine whether a source is credible?"},{"type":"h","text":"Geopolitics"},{"type":"p","text":"How would you analyse the strategic importance of a region?"},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse a defence/public-policy dataset and identify the major trends."},{"type":"h","text":"Writing"},{"type":"p","text":"Write a 500-word policy brief for a senior decision-maker."},{"type":"h","text":"Scenario analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"A major geopolitical event changes the security environment. How would you structure your research response?"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest candidates demonstrate evidence-based reasoning rather than ideological or purely opinion-based arguments."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree can significantly strengthen this career."},{"type":"h","text":"Strong options"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MA Defence & Strategic Studies"},{"text":"MA Strategic Studies"},{"text":"MA International Relations"},{"text":"MA Political Science"},{"text":"MA International Security"},{"text":"MA Security Studies"},{"text":"MA Public Policy"},{"text":"MA Geopolitics"},{"text":"MA Conflict Studies"},{"text":"MA Peace & Conflict Studies"},{"text":"MA/ MSc Defence Technology-related programmes"},{"text":"MBA/PGDM Public Policy or related management route"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data-oriented route"},{"type":"p","text":"For technology-policy careers:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Defence & Strategic Studies","Master's in Public Policy/International Security","Data/AI specialisation"]},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA","MA Strategic Studies","Technology/AI/Cyber/Space Security specialisation"]}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential master's areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strategic Studies"},{"text":"International Security"},{"text":"Defence Studies"},{"text":"War Studies"},{"text":"International Relations"},{"text":"Security Studies"},{"text":"Public Policy"},{"text":"Global Affairs"},{"text":"Geopolitics"},{"text":"Peace & Conflict Studies"},{"text":"Intelligence & Security Studies"},{"text":"Cybersecurity Policy"},{"text":"Space Policy"},{"text":"Technology Policy"},{"text":"Defence Economics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong future combinations"},{"type":"h","text":"Strategic Studies + AI"},{"type":"h","text":"International Security + Cyber Policy"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Policy + Data Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Defence Studies + Space Policy"},{"type":"h","text":"International Relations + Geopolitical Risk"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Research Intern","Research Assistant","Policy Research Associate","Policy Researcher / Policy Analyst","Senior Policy Analyst / Research Fellow","Senior Research Fellow","Programme Director / Research Lead","Research Director / Policy Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"Specialist route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Assistant","Defence Research Analyst","Defence Policy Specialist","Senior Strategic Affairs Analyst","Strategic Affairs / Security Research Lead","National Security / Defence Policy Specialist"]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Career Evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"Policy research will increasingly combine human strategic judgement with AI-supported evidence analysis."},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging roles"},{"type":"list","